1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,100
Every method Sari used was built by someone like Arif.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:08,780
He turns his strategy into a method, seals the code before it leaves his machine, and publishes it on NEAR with a price.

3
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:12,130
He earns every time someone uses it, and nobody ever sees his rules.

4
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:15,360
And when Sari finds a gap in his method, they fix it together.

